  "notes": "v2 replaces the <table> with a vanilla-extract styled ARIA grid (role=grid/row/gridcell/columnheader divs) rendered inside an <fd-server-grid> declarative shadow root; rows are grouped by region (group rows inserted) and sorted by name, columns are reordered and renamed (Hostname->Name, IP address->Private IP, OS->Image) with a Public IP column inserted, Reboot becomes Restart, the console button loses its title, row ids/values are replaced by opaque data-rowid hashes, and a hidden column-visibility menu plus a light-DOM 'Needs attention' list repeat column names, statuses and Restart actions.",
